                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 3123/8.</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Graves to the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Stockholm</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1907-12-10"><hi rendition="#italic">December 10,
                        1907</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(States that the funeral of the King of Sweden will take place on the 19th of
                    December, and that Great Britain, Germany, Austria, and other countries will be
                    represented by a member of the royal family. France will probably have special
                    representatives.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
